{"ref":"BDB, קָשַׁב","hw":"קָשַׁב","html":"<big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">קָשַׁב</span></big></big><sub>46</sub><big><big>]</big></big>  <strong>vb. incline, attend</strong>, of ears;—<br>†<strong>Qal</strong>  Impf. 3 fpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּקְשַׁבְנָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 32:3\" href=\"/Isaiah.32.3\">Is 32:3</a> (subj. <span dir=\"rtl\">אזנים</span>).<br><strong>Hiph.</strong>  Pf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">הִקְשִׁיב</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 23:18\" href=\"/Jeremiah.23.18\">Je 23:18</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 66:19\" href=\"/Psalms.66.19\">ψ 66:19</a>, etc.; Impf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">יַקְשִׁב</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 42:23\" href=\"/Isaiah.42.23\">Is 42:23</a>, etc.; Imv. ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">הַקְשֵׁב</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 33:21\" href=\"/Job.33.21\">Jb 33:31</a>, especially <span dir=\"rtl\">הַקְשִׁ֫יבָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 5:3\" href=\"/Psalms.5.3\">ψ 5:3</a> +, etc.; Inf. cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">הַקְשִׁיב</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 15:22\" href=\"/I_Samuel.15.22\">1 S 15:22</a> +; Pt. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַקְשִׁיב</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 1:24\" href=\"/Proverbs.1.24\">Pr 1:24</a> +, pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַקְשִׁיבִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 8:13\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.8.13\">Ct 8:13</a>;—<em>give attention</em> (sometimes + <span dir=\"rtl\">שָׁמַע</span>); abs. <a data-ref=\"Hosea 5:1\" href=\"/Hosea.5.1\">Ho 5:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 15:22\" href=\"/I_Samuel.15.22\">1 S 15:22</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 10:30\" href=\"/Isaiah.10.30\">Is 10:30</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 28:23\" href=\"/Isaiah.28.23\">28:23</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 34:1\" href=\"/Isaiah.34.1\">34:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 49:1\" href=\"/Isaiah.49.1\">49:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Micah 1:2\" href=\"/Micah.1.2\">Mi 1:2</a> + 12 times; + <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶל</span> pers. <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 18:19\" href=\"/Jeremiah.18.19\">Je 18:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 1:4\" href=\"/Zechariah.1.4\">Zc 1:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 51:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.51.4\">Is 51:4</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">הֶאֱזִינוּ</span>), <span dir=\"rtl\">לְ</span> pers. <a data-ref=\"Psalms 55:3\" href=\"/Psalms.55.3\">ψ 55:3</a>; + <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶל</span> rei <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 18:18\" href=\"/Jeremiah.18.18\">Je 18:18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 9:34\" href=\"/Nehemiah.9.34\">Ne 9:34</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 142:7\" href=\"/Psalms.142.7\">ψ 142:7</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">עַל</span> rei <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 6:19\" href=\"/Jeremiah.6.19\">Je 6:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 17:4\" href=\"/Proverbs.17.4\">Pr 17:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 29:12\" href=\"/Proverbs.29.12\">29:12</a>, ל rei <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 6:17\" href=\"/Jeremiah.6.17\">Je 6:17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 48:18\" href=\"/Isaiah.48.18\">Is 48:18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 4:20\" href=\"/Proverbs.4.20\">Pr 4:20</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 5:1\" href=\"/Proverbs.5.1\">5:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 7:24\" href=\"/Proverbs.7.24\">7:24</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 5:3\" href=\"/Psalms.5.3\">ψ 5:3</a> <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 8:13\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.8.13\">Ct 8:13</a>, ב rei <a data-ref=\"Psalms 66:19\" href=\"/Psalms.66.19\">ψ 66:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 86:6\" href=\"/Psalms.86.6\">86:6</a>; also c. acc. rei <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 23:18\" href=\"/Jeremiah.23.18\">Je 23:18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 13:6\" href=\"/Job.13.6\">Jb 13:6</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 17:1\" href=\"/Psalms.17.1\">ψ 17:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 61:2\" href=\"/Psalms.61.2\">61:2</a>; acc. cogn. <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 21:7\" href=\"/Isaiah.21.7\">Is 21:7</a>; appar. = <em>cause to attend</em>, c. acc. <span dir=\"rtl\">אָזְנֶ֑ךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 2:2\" href=\"/Proverbs.2.2\">Pr 2:2</a> (+ ל rei), <a data-ref=\"Psalms 10:17\" href=\"/Psalms.10.17\">ψ 10:17</a>, but usage would be so late and rare that <span dir=\"rtl\">אָזְנֶ֑ךָ</span> is prob. subj. rei (Ges<sup>§ 144 m</sup> Da<sup>Synt. § 109, R 3</sup>).","next":"BDB, קֶ֫שֶב","prev":"BDB, מִקְשָׁה³"}